# Parallel Agent Execution

When a task involves multiple independent sub-tasks (e.g. exploring different parts of the codebase, editing unrelated files, running separate searches), launch multiple agents in parallel rather than sequentially. This reduces wall-clock time and improves responsiveness.

Only serialize agents when one depends on the output of another.
